# Manual test cases

- Prefer the `manual-test-cases` skill when authoring new cases.
- One feature/flow per file under `docs/test-cases/` (kebab-case).
- Include Meta, Preconditions, at least one happy path and one negative/edge case, Expected results, Notes.
- Steps should name `data-testid` controls when they exist.
- Use seed logins only: customer / staff / admin `@marlow.test` with password `datalab`.
- Do not invent production URLs or non-seed credentials.
- When the user says the case is done / ready to automate, hand off per `test-creation.mdc` (API / e2e / stubbed).
